Package: mxlfs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: memory filesystem for MXL domains (DKMS source)
 mxlfs is a Linux memory filesystem for MXL domains: a tmpfs replacement
 whose files keep their data in unevictable large folios, plus views,
 files whose pages are switched between several source files without
 copying.
 .
 This package contains the module source and builds it with DKMS for
 each installed kernel of version 6.18 or newer.
